.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-admin-users-credits-add - Issue a goodwill account credit


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad admin users credits add [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Issue a positive goodwill account credit to a user.

.PP
This moves money into the user's balance and sends the backend credit
notification. Each successful call creates a new credit. If the request fails
after being sent, run "gumroad admin users credits list" for the user before
retrying to avoid issuing a duplicate credit.

.PP
Credits are capped at $1,000 per call unless --allow-large-amount is passed.
Negative credits and clawbacks are intentionally not supported by this CLI
command.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--allow-large-amount\fP[=false]
	Allow credits over the $1,000 per-call cap

.PP
\fB--amount-cents\fP=0
	Credit amount in cents (required, positive)

.PP
\fB--expected-email\fP=""
	Optional current email guard

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for add

.PP
\fB--reason\fP=""
	Reason shown in the creator notification and audit comment (required)

.PP
\fB--user-id\fP=""
	User external ID (required)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad admin users credits add --user-id 2245593582708 --amount-cents 1000 --reason "Goodwill for checkout bug" --dry-run
  gumroad admin users credits add --user-id 2245593582708 --expected-email seller@example.com --amount-cents 1000 --reason "Goodwill for checkout bug" --yes
  gumroad admin users credits add --user-id 2245593582708 --amount-cents 150000 --reason "Approved large goodwill credit" --allow-large-amount --yes
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-admin-users-credits(1)\fP
